        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$|3x-5|\\le7$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-\\dfrac23\\le x\\le4$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-7&\\le3x-5\\le7\\\\-2&\\le3x\\le12\\\\-\\frac23&\\le x\\le4\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p93-q12-14-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$|5x+2|>12$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x<-\\dfrac{14}{5}$ or $x>2$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5x+2&<-12\\quad\\text{or}\\quad5x+2>12\\\\5x&<-14\\quad\\text{or}\\quad5x>10\\\\x&<-\\frac{14}{5}\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x>2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p93-q12-14-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$2\\le|2x-3|<11$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-4<x\\le\\dfrac12$ or $\\dfrac52\\le x<7$.\n\nIntersect the solutions of $|2x-3|<11$ and $|2x-3|\\ge2$.",
          "worked": "For $|2x-3|<11$:\n$$\\begin{align*}-11&<2x-3<11\\\\-8&<2x<14\\\\-4&<x<7\\end{align*}$$\nFor $|2x-3|\\ge2$:\n$$\\begin{align*}2x-3&\\le-2\\quad\\text{or}\\quad2x-3\\ge2\\\\2x&\\le1\\quad\\text{or}\\quad2x\\ge5\\\\x&\\le\\frac12\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x\\ge\\frac52\\end{align*}$$\nBoth conditions must hold, so\n$$-4<x\\le\\frac12\\quad\\text{or}\\quad\\frac52\\le x<7.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 86
      }
    ]
